 <94746830+JapinanClarence@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 05:32:25 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] :sparkles: feat: support multiple institutions and
 departments per author

Move author affiliations into a new author_affiliations table so an
author can list many institutions, each with its own department, city
and country.

- add non-destructive migration that creates author_affiliations,
  backfills existing authors, relaxes NOT NULL on authors.school and
  sets up RLS (old columns are kept as a backup)
- add repeatable "Add Institution" group to the admin article form
- update zod schema, shared types and Supabase types
- save and load affiliations in the admin article service
- list every affiliation under each author on the public article page

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01C7NFsxas2YEHJdq4Aen1Gy
